    "active": true,
    "notes": "ip-address quadratic-time Address6 zone identifier matching. We do not parse untrusted addresses. Only copy is node_modules/npm/node_modules/ip-address (10.7.2), inside the npm CLI's bundled dependency tree (pulled in by semantic-release > @semantic-release/npm > npm, overridden to 11.21.1). Bundled deps are frozen in npm's published tarball and cannot be reached by `overrides`. Release-time tooling only, never reachable from compiler or runtime code. Remove once npm bundles ip-address >10.7.3.",
